{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15167","headline":"过马嵬二首 一 · 李益","name":"过马嵬二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路至墙垣问樵者，顾予云是太真宫。\n太真血染马蹄尽，朱阁影随天际空。\n丹壑不闻歌吹夜，玉堦唯有薜萝风。\n世人莫重霓裳曲，曾致干戈是此中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15167.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15167","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}